Mugi
before we dive into uncertainty again,
I have to tell you something.
Thank you for stopping Mugi from destroying the world.
Your courage and determination saved the whole world.
I know that the decision you had to make was terribly difficult.
Killing your own brother is a burden 
that no one should have to bear.
Although it may seem unbearable,
know that what you did was necessary for the good of all.
As a guardian of the dimensions,
I know that Wugi's soul is grateful for freeing
him from the yoke of the element of evil
that nearly soiled his soul.
Your actions freed him from suffering and allowed
him to find peace.
However, we cannot rest on our laurels.
Although Wugi's powers have been completely destroyed,
the element of evil continues to inflict damage on other worlds.
The darkness he carries hasn't disappeared,
and his influence is spreading,
threatening the peace we have managed to regain.
Get ready, Mugi. 
We will have to face this new threat.
Together we will survive this challenge,
just as we survived the last one. Our fight is not over, 
and the alliance we have formed is stronger than ever